Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:05.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sunshine Double belongs to Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光双冠属于萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:08.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's the last thing I can...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在我最不想做的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I want to do right now is give speech,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就是发表感言
