Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.64,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季的开局 已经有了一座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:32.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mission accomplished for Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡如愿以偿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:35.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's the champion once again in Brisbane.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她再次成为布里斯班冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:38.42,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛 决胜盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
