Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:59.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sunshine Double belongs to Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光双冠属于萨巴伦卡
