Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match for Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 莱巴金娜获胜
