Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:54.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Nikola Bartunkova gets it done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N巴尔通科娃赢下了比赛
