Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:19.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a tournament that has already produced headlines in its opening three days,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛事前三天已经新闻不断
