Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:25.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in all capital letters above the fold.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用醒目的大字 登上头版
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:30.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}座冠军 两次大满贯亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.10,TL,,0,0,0,,亚洲赛季{\fs78}3{\fs68}场一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.81,TL,,0,0,0,,她带着这些起伏走向年终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.38,TL,,0,0,0,,你最期待她找回什么？
